-- Equilibration of a compositional model with the composition versus depth
-- from ZMFVD (EQUIL item 10 defaulted to 1: the pressure is integrated from
-- the datum as a single hydrocarbon phase). A 1x1x20 vertical column of a
-- CO2/methane/decane mixture grading from methane-rich at the top to
-- decane-rich at the bottom. The methane-rich top flashes to a gas fraction
-- under this pressure profile, so the column is not in gravity equilibrium:
-- there are no wells, and the few short time steps capture the start of the
-- segregation.

------------------------------------------------------------------------
RUNSPEC
------------------------------------------------------------------------
TITLE
   COMPOSITIONAL EQUILIBRATION WITH ZMFVD

METRIC

TABDIMS
/
OIL
GAS
DIMENS
1 1 20 /

COMPS
3 /

START
  1 'JAN' 2016  /

REGDIMS
1 1 0 0 /

EQLDIMS
/

UNIFIN
UNIFOUT
------------------------------------------------------------------------
GRID
------------------------------------------------------------------------
INIT
GRIDFILE
0 1 /
DX
20*5 /

DY
20*100 /

DZ
  20*5 /

TOPS
  1*2000.0 /

PORO
  20*0.3/

PERMX
  20*2000/

PERMY
  20*2000/

PERMZ
  20*2000/

------------------------------------------------------------------------
EDIT
------------------------------------------------------------------------


------------------------------------------------------------------------
PROPS
------------------------------------------------------------------------

CNAMES
CO2
METHANE
DECANE
/

ROCK
68.9476
0
/

ZMFVD
-- depth  CO2  METHANE DECANE
 2000   0 0.7 0.3
 2100   0 0.3 0.7  /

RTEMP
100
/

EOS
PR /

BIC
0
0
0
/

ACF
0.22394
0.01142
0.4884
/
PCRIT
73.773
45.992
21.03
/
TCRIT
304.128
190.564
617.7
/
MW
44.00
16.04
142.28
/

VCRIT
0.09412
0.09863
0.60980
/

SGOF
-- Sg    Krg    Kro    Pcgo
0.0000 0.0000 1.0000 0.0000
0.0500 0.0025 0.9025 0.0000
0.1000 0.0100 0.8100 0.0000
0.1500 0.0225 0.7225 0.0000
0.2000 0.0400 0.6400 0.0000
0.2500 0.0625 0.5625 0.0000
0.3000 0.0900 0.4900 0.0000
0.3500 0.1225 0.4225 0.0000
0.4000 0.1600 0.3600 0.0000
0.4500 0.2025 0.3025 0.0000
0.5000 0.2500 0.2500 0.0000
0.5500 0.3025 0.2025 0.0000
0.6000 0.3600 0.1600 0.0000
0.6500 0.4225 0.1225 0.0000
0.7000 0.4900 0.0900 0.0000
0.7500 0.5625 0.0625 0.0000
0.8000 0.6400 0.0400 0.0000
0.8500 0.7225 0.0225 0.0000
0.9000 0.8100 0.0100 0.0000
0.9500 0.9025 0.0025 0.0000
1.0000 1.0000 0.0000 0.0000
/


STCOND
15.0 1.0 /

------------------------------------------------------------------------
SOLUTION
------------------------------------------------------------------------
RPTRST
  BASIC=2 PRESSURE SOIL SGAS PSAT XMF YMF VMF ZMF POIL PGAS DENG DENO /

EQUIL
-- datum  datum   WOC    WOC    GOC    GOC
-- depth  press   depth  Pcow   depth  Pcog
   2010     150    2300   0      2000    0     /

RPTSOL
  PRESSURE SOIL SGAS POIL PGAS DENG DENO /


------------------------------------------------------------------------
SUMMARY
------------------------------------------------------------------------
ALL

------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCHEDULE
------------------------------------------------------------------------
RPTSCHED
  'PRES' SGAS /

RPTRST
BASIC = 2
PRESSURE
SGAS
SOIL
PSAT
XMF
YMF
ZMF
DENO
DENG
VGAS
VOIL
/

TSTEP
    0.0100
    0.0200
    0.1
    0.2
/
END
